=\"Wiktionary:International Phonetic Alphabet\">IPA</a><sup>(<a href=\"/wiki/Appendix:English_pronunciation\" title=\"Appendix:English pronunciation\">key</a>)</sup>: <span class=\"IPA nowrap\">/ˈwɔː.təɹ/</span>, <span class=\"IPA nowrap\">[ˈwɒː.θ̠ɚ]</span>, <span class=\"IPA nowrap\">[ˈwɔːʔəɹ]</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"ib-brac qualifier-brac\">(</span><span class=\"ib-content qualifier-content\"><span class=\"usage-label-accent\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Indian_English#Phonology\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:Indian English\">India</a></span></span><span class=\"ib-brac qualifier-brac\">)</span> <a href=\"/wiki/Wiktionary:International_Phonetic_Alphabet\" title=\"Wiktionary:International Phonetic Alphabet\">IPA</a><sup>(<a href=\"/wiki/Appendix:English_pronunciation\" title=\"Appendix:English pronunciation\">key</a>)</sup>: <span class=\"IPA nowrap\">[ˈwɔ(ː).ʈə(ɾ)]</span>, <span class=\"IPA nowrap\">[ˈʋɔ(ː).ʈə(ɾ)]</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"ib-brac qualifier-brac\">(</span><span class=\"ib-content qualifier-content\"><span class=\"usage-label-accent\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Regional_differences_and_dialects_in_Indian_English#Southern_Indian_English\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:Regional differences and dialects in Indian English\">Tamil Nadu</a></span></span><span class=\"ib-brac qualifier-brac\">)</span> <a href=\"/wiki/Wiktionary:International_Phonetic_Alphabet\" title=\"Wiktionary:International Phonetic Alphabet\">IPA</a><sup>(<a href=\"/wiki/Appendix:English_pronunciation\" title=\"Appendix:English pronunciation\">key</a>)</sup>: <span class=\"IPA nowrap\">[ˈʋäː.ʈ(ə)ɾ(ɯ)]</span>, <span class=\"IPA nowrap\">[ˈwäː.ʈ(ə)ɾ(ɯ)]</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"ib-brac qualifier-brac\">(</span><span class=\"ib-content qualifier-content\"><span class=\"usage-label-accent\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/South_African_English_phonology\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:South African English phonology\">General South African</a></span