ish\" title=\"father\">father</a></i>).\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"Etymology_1\">Etymology 1</h3><span class=\"mw-editsection\" data-nosnippet=\"\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=water&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Etymology 1\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r91772659\">.mw-parser-output .etytree{width:max-content;max-width:100%;overflow:hidden;box-sizing:border-box}.mw-parser-output .etytree .NavHead{background:var(--wikt-palette-lightergrey)}.mw-parser-output .etytree .NavHead>div{width:25em}.mw-parser-output .etytree .NavContent{overflow:auto}.mw-parser-output .etytree-body{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;padding:0.5em;margin:auto;width:fit-content}.mw-parser-output .etytree-branch-group{display:flex;column-gap:0.5em;align-items:end;position:relative}.mw-parser-output .etytree-branch{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center}.mw-parser-output .etytree-block{position:relative;padding:5px 10px;border:1px solid var(--wikt-palette-lightgrey,#ddd);border-radius:4px;background:var(--wikt-palette-beige);text-align:center}.mw-parser-output .etytree-termless-block{height:0!important;padding:0!important;border:none!important;background:transparent!important;margin:0!important;overflow:visible}.mw-parser-output .etytree-block.etytree-duplicate{border:1px dashed var(--wikt-palette-grey)}.mw-parser-output .etytree-term{display:inline-block}.mw-parser-output .etytree-connector-vertical,.mw-parser-output .etytree-connector-vertical-short{border-right:2px solid var(--wikt-palette-grey,#999);position:relative;transform:translateX(1px)}.mw-parser-output .etytree-connector-vertical{height:20px}.mw-parser-output .etytree-connector-vertical-short{height:10px}.mw-parser-output .etytree-connector-dotted{border-left:2px dotted var(--wikt-palette-grey);height:20px;