 ſwa great ſwa a beam:<br>þe he leide in ane walle ſtream.<br>Þe ilke makeð þat <b>water</b> hot:<br>&amp; þan folc halwende.</span><dl><dd><small>(please <a href=\"/wiki/Wiktionary:Quotations#Adding_translations_to_quotations\" title=\"Wiktionary:Quotations\">add an English translation</a> of this quotation)</small></dd></dl></div></dd></dl></div></li></ul></li>\n<li><span class=\"Latn\" lang=\"en\"><a href=\"/wiki/water_vapour#English\" title=\"water vapour\">water vapour</a></span>, <a href=\"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/condensation#English\" title=\"condensation\">condensation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/lake#English\" title=\"lake\">lake</a>, <a href=\"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/pond#English\" title=\"pond\">pond</a>, <a href=\"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/ocean#English\" title=\"ocean\">ocean</a>, <a href=\"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/canal#English\" title=\"canal\">canal</a>, body of water</li>\n<li>water source, <a href=\"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/spring#English\" title=\"spring\">spring</a>, <a href=\"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/well#English\" title=\"well\">well</a>, <a href=\"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/fount#English\" title=\"fount\">fount</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/solution#English\" title=\"solution\">solution</a>, liquid mixture</li></ol>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading4\"><h4 id=\"Quotations\">Quotations</h4><span class=\"mw-editsection\" data-nosnippet=\"\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=water&amp;action=edit&amp;section=67\" title=\"Edit section: Quotations\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<ul><li><span class=\"see-cites\">For quotations using this term, see <a href=\"/wiki/Citations:water#Middle_English\" title=\"Citations:water\">Citations:water</a>.</span></li></ul>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading4\"><h4 id=\"Derived_terms_7\">Derived terms</h4><span class=\"mw-edit