rences</h4><span class=\"mw-editsection\" data-nosnippet=\"\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=water&amp;action=edit&amp;section=70\" title=\"Edit section: References\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<ul><li>“<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://quod.lib.umich.edu/m/middle-english-dictionary/dictionary/MED51881\">wā̆ter, <i>n.</i></a>”, in <span class=\"citation-whole\"><span class=\"cited-source\"><cite><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Middle_English_Dictionary\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:Middle English Dictionary\">MED Online</a></cite>, Ann Arbor, Mich.: <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/University_of_Michigan\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:University of Michigan\">University of Michigan</a>, <span class=\"None\" lang=\"und\">2007</span>, retrieved <span class=\"mw-formatted-date\" title=\"2018-03-20\">20 March 2018</span></span></span>.</li></ul>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Middle_Low_German\">Middle Low German</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\" data-nosnippet=\"\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=water&amp;action=edit&amp;section=71\" title=\"Edit section: Middle Low German\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"Etymology_9\">Etymology</h3><span class=\"mw-editsection\" data-nosnippet=\"\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=water&amp;action=edit&amp;section=72\" title=\"Edit section: Etymology\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<p>From <span class=\"etyl\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Old_Saxon\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:Old Saxon\">Old Saxon</a></span> <i class=\"Latn mention\" lang=\"osx\"><a href=\"/wiki/watar#Old_Saxon\" title=\"watar\">watar</a></i>.\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"Pronunciation_8\">Pronunciation</h3><span class=\"mw-editsection\" data-nosnippet=\"\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=water&amp;action=edit&amp;section=73\" title=\"Edit section: Pronunciation\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<ul><li><span class=\"ib-brac qualifier-brac\">(</span><span class=\"ib-content qualifier-content\"><span class=\"usage-label-accent\">originally</span></span><span class=\"ib-brac qualifier-brac\">)</span> <a href=\"/wiki/Wiktionary:International_Phonetic_Alphabet\" title=\"Wiktionary:International Phonetic Alphabet\">IPA</a><sup>(<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Middle_Low_German_phonology\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"wikipedia:Middle Low German phonology\">key</a>)</sup>: <span class=\"IPA nowrap\">/ˈwaːtər/</span></li></ul>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"Noun_11\">Noun</h3><span class=\"mw-editsection\" data-nosnippet=\"\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=water&amp;action=edit&amp;section=74\" title=\"Edit section: Noun\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<p><span class=\"headword-line\"><strong class=\"Latn headword\" lang=\"gml\">wāter</strong>&nbsp;<span class=\"gender\"><abbr title=\"neuter gender\">n</abbr></span></span>\n</p>\n<ol><li><span class=\"Latn\" lang=\"en\"><a class=\"mw-selflink-fragment\" href=\"#English\">water</a></span>\n<span class=\"HQToggle\" data-nosnippet=\"\" style=\"margin-left: 5px;\"><a role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\">quotations&nbsp;▼</a></span><ul class=\"wikt-quote-container\" style=\"display: none;\"><li><div class=\"citation-whole\"><span class=\"cited-source\"><span class=\"None\" lang=\"und\"><b>1537</b></span>, Jürgen Richolff the Younger, <cite>Datt högeste unde öldeste water recht</cite>, section XXVIII:</span><dl><dd><div class=\"h-quotation\"><span class=\"Latn e-quotation cited-passage\" lang=\"gml\">Eyn <span class=\"Latn\" lang=\"gml\"><a href=\"/wiki/schip#Middle_Low_German\" title=\"schip\">schip</a></span> effte twe effte meer liggen in einer hauen dar <span class=\"Latn\" lang=\"gml\"><a href=\"/wiki/kleine#Middle_Low_German\" title=\"kleine\">kleyn</a></span> <b>water</b> is<br>vnde plecht dröge <span class=\"Latn\" lang=\"gml\"><a href=\"/wiki/wesen#Middle_Low_German\" title=\"wesen\">tho synde</a></span><br>also dat dat eyne schip hart by dem andern tho liggende kumpt <span class=\"q-hellip-sp\"> </span><span class=\"q-hellip-b\">[</span>…<span class=\"q-hellip-b\">]</span><span class=\"q-hellip-b\"></span></span><dl><dd><span class=\"e-translation\">A ship or two or more lie in a port with little water, which tends to be dry, so that one the ship comes to lie close by the other <span class=\"q-hellip-sp\"> </span><span class=\"q-hellip-b\">[</span>…<span class=\"q-hellip-b\">]</span><span class=\"q-hellip-b\"> </span></span></dd></dl></div></dd></dl></div></li></ul></li></ol>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading4\"><h4 id=\"Declension\">Declension</h4><span class=\"mw-editsection\" data-nosnippet=\"\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=water&amp;action=edit&amp;section=75\" title=\"Edit section: Declension\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"inflection-table-wrapper inflection-table-collapsible inflection-table-collapsed\" style=\"width: fit-content; min-width: 26em\" data-wikt-palette-p=\"grey\" data-toggle-category=\"inflection\">\n<table class=\"inflection-table\">\n<caption class=\"inflection-table-title\" style=\"cursor: pointer;\"><span class=\"NavToggle\" data-nosnippet=\"\"><a role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\">show ▼</a></span>Declension of <i class=\"Latn mention\" lang=\"gml\">water</i>\n</caption>\n\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/singular\" title=\"singular\">singular</a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=